Primary sources:
- https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-VL-Realtime/tree/d1f71a588deaf2b9b9cea7c6fff66cb10847cc86
- https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-VL/tree/a62bd885ba96a3184ab1584e9f89482d6a9e9c38/inference/realtime

The upstream deployment currently pins PyTorch 2.8 CUDA 12.8. This Vonk source
context is a thin, unaccepted CUDA 13 ARM64 adaptation for DGX Spark. It must
pass an ARM64 container build and a physical Spark canary before acceptance.

TorchCodec 0.17.0+cpu uses PyTorch's stable ABI (torch >=2.11), compatible with
this image's torch 2.14.0+cu130. The hash-locked CPython 3.12 manylinux aarch64
CPU wheel decodes frames without NVDEC. The image imports VideoDecoder during
its build; the shared recipe-images remote-code smoke checks every pinned
model Python module before publication.
